# The native build output: 149 MB of the 154 MB this tree measures, and every
# byte of it is regenerated by deploy.sh.
app/src/main/cpp/build-arm64/

# THE PLATFORM SIGNING KEY IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY, AND MUST NOT BE.
#
# keys/platform.pk8 and keys/platform.x509.pem are the AOSP platform key for
# this GSI. They are what make CAPTURE_VIDEO_OUTPUT, CAPTURE_SECURE_VIDEO_OUTPUT,
# MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING and DUMP grantable at install with no dialog - which is
# to say they are the whole reason this app can do what it does, and anyone
# holding them can sign an app this tablet will trust completely.
#
# They are handed over out of band. A clone without them builds, and the jack
# and the recorder do not work until they are put back - see deploy.sh.
keys/
*.pk8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12

# Root-level deployment screenshots and Android diagnostics are local QA
# evidence. Source fixtures live below app/src and tests instead.
/*.png
/tablet-anr-*.zip
